Z||000006||DRH||07-15-2001||05:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Toddster:<BR><B>Welcome to America Bam Bam. It's this damned First Amenedment thing. If we could only do away with that and control what everybody said then we could have our way couldn't we?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Couldn't resist this one.<P>It's not America... note the <B>.nl</B> on the address where you're posting.<P>Even if it were, there are <B>no</B> first ammendment issues here. This is a private site and <B>you</B> agreed the administrator could delete anything he saw fit whenever he wanted to when you signed up to post here.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Toddster||07-15-2001||05:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B> <BR>Even if it were, there are [b]no</B> first ammendment issues here. This is a private site and <B>you</B> agreed the administrator could delete anything he saw fit whenever he wanted to when you signed up to post here.<BR>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>What I note DRH is that YOU are in America, I am in America, and Bam Bam is in America. And last time I read the law an internationally managed web site does not force you to abrogate your rights under the Constitution.<P>I recognize your right to say what ever you want. Why don't you and Bam Bam recognize mine?<P>Or is it that I can say anything I want as long as it meets with your approval?<P>Grow up.  ||||reg||1
